    {
      "name": "Beetles Build",
      "label": "Recommended",
      "description": "Anub'arak's Beetles Build increases his sustain damage and self-sustain during prolonged team fights and when pushing. In the mid game you also gain some waveclear.\n\nThe increased damage and waveclear mainly come from Burning Beetles at Level 13. The survivability comes from Leeching Scarabs at Level 7 and potentially from Legion of Beetles at Level 1 blocking skillshots.\n\nLast but not the least, Legion of Beetles at Level 1 spawns additional Beetles and makes them harder to kill, allowing you to get more value from the rest of the Build.",
