    {
      "name": "Harden Carapace Build",
      "label": "Situational",
      "description": "Anub'arak's Harden Carapace Build increases his mobility to reposition in team fights and dodge skillshots, burst damage to secure kills, and survivability against Spell Damage.\n\nConsider going for this Build when playing against Heroes who can deal Spell Damage with high tick rate (like Tassadar) or as damage over time (such as Lunara). This will trigger Chitinous Plating at Level 7 and thus allow you to get more value from Harden Carapace-related Talent.",
